    background:violet; color:inherit;">Bopomofo<br/><div style="font-weight:normal"></div></th></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-image" style="padding-top:0.4em;padding-bottom:0.4em;"><span class="skin-invert-image" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Zhuyinbaike.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Zhuyinbaike.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Zhuyinbaike.svg/250px-Zhuyinbaike.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Zhuyinbaike.svg/500px-Zhuyinbaike.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="74" data-file-type="drawing" height="36" width="250" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span><div class="infobox-caption" style="border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;">The word "encyclopedia" (bǎikē quánshū) written in bopomofo (b-ai k-e q-u-an sh-u)</div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;">Script type</th><td class="infobox-data"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; line-height:1.25em">     <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semisyllabary" title="Semisyllabary" class="mw-redirect">Semisyllabary</a>
          </div> with diacritics for tones</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;">Creator</th><td class="infobox-data">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commission_on_the_Unification_of_Pronunciation" title="Commission on the Unification of Pronunciation">Commission on the Unification of Pronunciation</a></li>
<li>Introduced by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beiyang_government" title="Beiyang government">Beiyang government</a> of the Republic of China</li></ul>
</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Period</div></th><td class="infobox-data">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mainland_China" title="Mainland China">Mainland China</a> (1918–1958)
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiandai_Hanyu_Cidian" title="Xiandai Hanyu Cidian">Xiandai Hanyu Cidian</a></i> (<span class="nowrap">1960–present</span>; as a supplement to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanyu_Pinyin" title="Hanyu Pinyin" class="mw-redirect">Hanyu Pinyin</a>)</li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan" title="Taiwan">Taiwan</a> (1945–present)</li></ul>
</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;">Direction</th><td class="infobox-data">Left-to-right, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bidirectional_text" title="Bidirectional text">bidirectional text</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vertical_writing" title="Vertical writing" class="mw-redirect">vertical writing</a>, vertical right-to-left<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span class="penicon autoconfirmed-show"><span class="mw-valign-text-top" typeof="mw:File/Frameless" data-mw='{"caption":"Edit this on Wikidata"}'><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q198269?uselang=en#P1406" title="Edit this on Wikidata"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Edit this on Wikidata" data-file-width="20" data-file-height="20" data-file-type="drawing" height="10" width="10" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-header" style="background:#ddd; color:inherit;">Related scripts</th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Parent systems</div></th><td class="infobox-data"><div style="padding-top:0.15em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oracle_bone_script" title="Oracle bone script">Oracle bone script</a><ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seal_script" title="Seal script">Seal script</a><ul style="margin-left:0.8em;"><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clerical_script" title="Clerical script">Clerical script</a><ul style="margin-left:0.8em;"><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_script" title="Han script" class="mw-redirect">Han script</a><ul style="margin-left:0.8em;"><li>Bopomofo</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Child systems</div></th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cantonese_bopomofo" title="Cantonese bopomofo">Cantonese bopomofo</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwanese_Phonetic_Symbols" title="Taiwanese Phonetic Symbols">Taiwanese Phonetic Symbols</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suzhou_Phonetic_Symbols?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Suzhou Phonetic Symbols (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Suzhou Phonetic Symbols"]}}'>Suzhou Phonetic Symbols</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hmu_Phonetic_Symbols?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Hmu Phonetic Symbols (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Hmu Phonetic Symbols"]}}'>Hmu Phonetic Symbols</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matsu_Fuchounese_bopomofo?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Matsu Fuchounese bopomofo (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Matsu Fuchounese bopomofo"]}}'>Matsu Fuchounese bopomofo</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/馬祖閩東（福州）語注音符號" title="zh:馬祖閩東（福州）語注音符號" class="extiw">zh</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span><span style="display:none" data-plural="1"></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-header" style="background:#ddd; color:inherit;">ISO 15924</th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15924" title="ISO 15924">ISO 15924</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r886049734" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt7" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .monospaced{font-family:monospace,monospace}</style><span class="monospaced">Bopo</span> <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt8" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">(285)</span>,<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">​</span>Bopomofo<link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Scripts_with_ISO_15924_four-letter_codes"/></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-header" style="background:#ddd; color:inherit;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unicode" title="Unicode">Unicode</a></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Unicode alias</div></th><td class="infobox-data">Bopomofo</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="padding-right:0.6em;"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; "><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unicode_range" title="Unicode range" class="mw-redirect">Unicode range</a></div></th><td class="infobox-data"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1126788409" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt9" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style></span><div class="plainlist"><ul style="margin-left:1em;text-indent:-1em;"><li><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.unicode.org/charts/PDF/U3100.pdf" class="external text">U+3100–U+312F</a> <span class="nowrap">(Bopomofo)</span></li><li><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.unicode.org/charts/PDF/U31A0.pdf" class="external text">U+31A0–U+31BF</a> <span class="nowrap">(Bopomofo Extended)</span></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-below noprint selfref" style="text-align:left; background:#eee; color:inherit;"><span style="font-size:90%"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>This article contains <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phonetic_transcription" title="Phonetic transcription">phonetic transcriptions</a> in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Phonetic_Alphabet" title="International Phonetic Alphabet">International Phonetic Alphabet</a> (IPA)</b>.<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>For an introductory guide on IPA symbols, see <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA" title="Help:IPA">Help:IPA</a>.<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>For the distinction between <span class="IPA nowrap" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">[<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>]</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_with_plain_IPA"/>, <span class="IPA nowrap" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)">/<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>/</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_with_plain_IPA"/> and <span typeof="mw:Entity">⟨</span><span class="IPA nowrap" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_with_plain_IPA"/><span typeof="mw:Entity">⟩</span>, see <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Phonetic_Alphabet#Brackets_and_transcription_delimiters" title="International Phonetic Alphabet">IPA §<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Brackets and transcription delimiters</a>.</span></td></tr></tbody></table>
