<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="color: var(--color-base)"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_alphabet" title="History of the alphabet">History of the alphabet</a></div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content"><sup>‡</sup> Entries marked with a double dagger are non-alphabetic<br/>
<hr/>
<div class="treelist"> 
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egyptian_hieroglyphs" title="Egyptian hieroglyphs">Egyptian hieroglyphs</a></i><sup>‡</sup> 32nd <abbr title="century" about="#mwt32" typeof="mw:ExpandedAttrs" data-mw='{"attribs":[[{"txt":"title"},{"html":"&lt;span typeof=\"mw:Nowiki\" id=\"mwEA\">century&lt;/span>"}]]}'>c.</abbr> BCE
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hieratic" title="Hieratic">Hieratic</a></i><sup>‡</sup> 32nd c. BCE
<ul><li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demotic_Egyptian_script" title="Demotic Egyptian script">Demotic</a></i><sup>‡</sup> 7th c. BCE
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meroitic_script" title="Meroitic script">Meroitic</a> 3rd c. BCE</li></ul></li></ul></li>
<li><i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proto-Sinaitic" title="Proto-Sinaitic" class="mw-redirect">Proto-Sinaitic</a></i><sup>‡</sup> 19th c. BCE
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ugaritic_alphabet" title="Ugaritic alphabet">Ugaritic</a> 15th c. BCE</li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_South_Arabian_script" title="Ancient South Arabian script">Ancient South Arabian</a> 9th c. BCE
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geʽez_script" title="Geʽez script">Geʽez</a> <abbr title="circa">c.</abbr><span style="white-space:nowrap;"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>5th c. BCE</span></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phoenician_alphabet" title="Phoenician alphabet">Phoenician</a> 12th c. BCE
<ul><li><span role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable crossreference selfref">(see <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#tp-abchistory-phx" class="mw-selflink-fragment">below</a>)</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hangul" title="Hangul">Hangul</a> 1443</li>
