<td id="mwATQ">From <span lang="zh" about="#mwt132" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"𠚣"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/𠚣#Chinese" title="wikt:𠚣" class="extiw">𠚣</a></span>, archaic form of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt133" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"刀"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/刀#Chinese" title="wikt:刀" class="extiw">刀</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwATc"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt134" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwATg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"dāo"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">dāo</i></span>, "blade". Compare the <i id="mwATk">Shuowen</i> seal <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwATo"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:刀-seal.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwATs"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:刀-seal.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/%E5%88%80-seal.svg/40px-%E5%88%80-seal.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/%E5%88%80-seal.svg/60px-%E5%88%80-seal.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="22" width="22" class="mw-file-element" id="mwATw"/></a></span>.</td>
