<td id="mwApI">Modified from the seal script <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwApM"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:日-seal.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwApQ"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:日-seal.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/%E6%97%A5-seal.svg/40px-%E6%97%A5-seal.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/%E6%97%A5-seal.svg/60px-%E6%97%A5-seal.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="22" width="22" class="mw-file-element" id="mwApU"/></a></span> form of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt264" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwApY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"日"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/日#Chinese" title="wikt:日" class="extiw">日</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwApc"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt265" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwApg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"rì"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">rì</i></span>, "day" or "sun".</td>
