<td id="mwAs8">From <span lang="zh" about="#mwt288" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"𠀁"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/𠀁#Chinese" title="wikt:𠀁" class="extiw">𠀁</a></span>, archaic form of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt289" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"七"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/七#Chinese" title="wikt:七" class="extiw">七</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAtI"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt290" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"qī"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">qī</i></span>, dialectically <span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt291" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"ciī"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">ciī</i></span> (<span class="IPA nowrap" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" title="Representation in the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA)" about="#mwt292" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA","href":"./Template:IPA"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"[tsʰí]"}},"i":0}}]}'>[tsʰí]</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Pages_with_plain_IPA" about="#mwt292" id="mwAtY"/>; <i about="#mwt293" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Zh-no-labels","href":"./Template:Zh-no-labels"},"params":{"w":{"wt":"tsʻi¹"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Latn-wadegile">tsʻi¹</span></i> in Wade–Giles). Compare semi-cursive form <span class="mw-default-size skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwAtg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Qi1_seven_semicursive.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwAtk"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Qi1_seven_semicursive.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Qi1_seven_semicursive.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="23" data-file-height="18" data-file-type="bitmap" height="18" width="23" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAto"/></a></span> and seal-script <span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwAts"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:七-seal.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwAtw"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:七-seal.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/%E4%B8%83-seal.svg/40px-%E4%B8%83-seal.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/%E4%B8%83-seal.svg/60px-%E4%B8%83-seal.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="22" width="22" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAt0"/></a></span>.</td>
