<td id="mwAvQ">From the archaic character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt302" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"厶"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/厶#Chinese" title="wikt:厶" class="extiw">厶</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAvY"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt303" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"sī"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">sī</i></span>, which was later replaced by its compound <span lang="zh" about="#mwt304" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"私"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/私#Chinese" title="wikt:私" class="extiw">私</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAvk"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt305" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"sī"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">sī</i></span>.</td>
