<td id="mwAzM">From the obsolete character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt323" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAzQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"𠀀"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/𠀀#Chinese" title="wikt:𠀀" class="extiw">𠀀</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAzU"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt324" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAzY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"hē"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">hē</i></span>, inhalation, the reverse of <span lang="zh" about="#mwt325" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAzc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"丂"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/丂#Chinese" title="wikt:丂" class="extiw">丂</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAzg"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt326" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAzk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"kǎo"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">kǎo</i></span>, which is preserved as a phonetic in the compound <span lang="zh" about="#mwt327" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAzo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"可"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/可#Chinese" title="wikt:可" class="extiw">可</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAzs"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt328" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAzw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"kě"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">kě</i></span>.<sup about="#mwt331" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-u20000_12-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"u20000"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-u20000-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-u20000-12" id="mwAz0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAz4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAz8">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA0A">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
