<td id="mwA2Q">From <span lang="zh" about="#mwt344" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwA2U" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"也"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/也#Chinese" title="wikt:也" class="extiw">也</a></span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwA2Y"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt345" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwA2c" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"yě"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">yě</i></span>, "also". Compare the Warring States bamboo form <span class="mw-default-size skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwA2g"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ye3_also_chu3jian3_warring_state_of_chu3_small.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwA2k"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ye3_also_chu3jian3_warring_state_of_chu3_small.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Ye3_also_chu3jian3_warring_state_of_chu3_small.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled" decoding="async" loading="lazy" data-file-width="23" data-file-height="17" data-file-type="bitmap" height="17" width="23" class="mw-file-element" id="mwA2o"/></a></span></td>
