<td id="mwBJA"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt458" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBJE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"y"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Close_front_rounded_vowel" title="Close front rounded vowel">y</a></span></td><td id="mwBJI">yu, -ü</td><td id="mwBJM">ü/yü</td><td id="mwBJQ"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt459" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBJU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"雨"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">雨</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt459" id="mwBJY"/><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBJc"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt460" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBJg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"yǔ"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">yǔ</i></span><br id="mwBJk"/><span class="nowrap" about="#mwt461" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBJo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"nowrap","href":"./Template:Nowrap"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{lang|zh-Bopo|ㄩˇ}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄩˇ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>;<br id="mwBJs"/><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt462" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBJw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"女"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">女</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt462" id="mwBJ0"/><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBJ4"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt463" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBJ8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"nǚ"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">nǚ</i></span><br id="mwBKA"/><span class="nowrap" about="#mwt464" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBKE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"nowrap","href":"./Template:Nowrap"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{lang|zh-Bopo|ㄋㄩˇ}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄋㄩˇ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span></td></tr>
<tr id="mwBKI">
<td id="mwBKM"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt465" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBKQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄭ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄭ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt465" id="mwBKU"/><br id="mwBKY"/><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBKc"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:MoeKai_Bopomofo_U+312D.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBKg"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:MoeKai_Bopomofo_U+312D.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/MoeKai_Bopomofo_U%2B312D.svg/20px-MoeKai_Bopomofo_U%2B312D.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/MoeKai_Bopomofo_U%2B312D.svg/40px-MoeKai_Bopomofo_U%2B312D.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="15" width="15" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBKk"/></a></span></td>
<td id="mwBKo">From the character <span lang="zh" about="#mwt466" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBKs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"帀"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/帀#Chinese" title="wikt:帀" class="extiw">帀</a></span>. It represents the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fricative_vowel" title="Fricative vowel" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBKw">fricative vowel</a> of <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt467" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBK0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄓ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄓ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt467" id="mwBK4"/>，<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt468" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBK8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄔ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄔ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt468" id="mwBLA"/>，<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt469" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBLE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄕ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄕ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt469" id="mwBLI"/>，<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt470" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBLM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄖ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄖ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt470" id="mwBLQ"/>，<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt471" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBLU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄗ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄗ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt471" id="mwBLY"/>，<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt472" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBLc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄘ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄘ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt472" id="mwBLg"/>，<span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt473" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBLk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄙ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄙ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt473" id="mwBLo"/>，though it is not used after them in transcription.<sup about="#mwt475" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-17" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-17" id="mwBLs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBLw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBL0">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBL4">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwBL8"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt476" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBMA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ɻ"},"2":{"wt":"ɻ̩"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_retroflex_approximant" title="Voiced retroflex approximant">ɻ̩</a></span>~<span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt477" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBME" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ʐ"},"2":{"wt":"ʐ̩"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_retroflex_fricative" title="Voiced retroflex fricative">ʐ̩</a></span>, <span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt478" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBMI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ɹ"},"2":{"wt":"ɹ̩"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_alveolar_approximant" title="Voiced alveolar approximant">ɹ̩</a></span>~<span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt479" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBMM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"z"},"2":{"wt":"z̩"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_alveolar_fricative" title="Voiced alveolar fricative">z̩</a></span></td><td id="mwBMQ">-i</td><td id="mwBMU">ih/ŭ</td><td id="mwBMY"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt480" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBMc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"資"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">資</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt480" id="mwBMg"/><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBMk"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt481" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBMo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"zī"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">zī</i></span><br id="mwBMs"/><span class="nowrap" about="#mwt482" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBMw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"nowrap","href":"./Template:Nowrap"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{lang|zh-Bopo|ㄗ}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄗ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>;<br id="mwBM0"/><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt483" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBM4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"知"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">知</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt483" id="mwBM8"/><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBNA"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt484" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBNE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"zhī"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">zhī</i></span><br id="mwBNI"/><span class="nowrap" about="#mwt485" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBNM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"nowrap","href":"./Template:Nowrap"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{lang|zh-Bopo|ㄓ}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄓ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span>;<br id="mwBNQ"/><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt486" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBNU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh"},"2":{"wt":"死"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh">死</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt486" id="mwBNY"/><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBNc"> </span><span title="ISO 7098 Chinese (Mandarin Chinese language) transliteration" about="#mwt487" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBNg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Transliteration","href":"./Template:Transliteration"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"cmn"},"2":{"wt":"ISO"},"3":{"wt":"sǐ"}},"i":0}}]}'><i lang="cmn-Latn">sǐ</i></span><br id="mwBNk"/><span class="nowrap" about="#mwt488" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBNo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"nowrap","href":"./Template:Nowrap"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{lang|zh-Bopo|ㄙˇ}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄙˇ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></span></td></tr>
</tbody></table>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwBNs" aria-labelledby="Writing"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Writing">Writing</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Bopomofo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Writing"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwBNw" aria-labelledby="Stroke_order"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Stroke_order">Stroke order</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Bopomofo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Stroke order"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBN0">Bopomofo is written in the same <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroke_order" title="Stroke order" id="mwBN4">stroke order</a> rule as Chinese characters. However, the number of strokes can differ from the derived character and the Bopomofo character. For example, <span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt489" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBN8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄖ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄖ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt489" id="mwBOA"/> is written with three strokes, unlike the character from which it is derived (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_language" title="Chinese language" about="#mwt490" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBOE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang-zh","href":"./Template:Lang-zh"},"params":{"c":{"wt":"日"},"p":{"wt":"rì"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt490">:</span><span about="#mwt490"> </span><span lang="zh" about="#mwt490"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/>日</span><span about="#mwt490">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt490">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt490">:</span><span about="#mwt490"> </span><i about="#mwt490" id="mwBOI"><span lang="zh-Latn">rì</span></i>), which has four strokes.</p>

<p id="mwBOM"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt491" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBOQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄧ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄧ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt491" id="mwBOU"/> can be written as a vertical line (<span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBOY"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Bpmf-i2.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBOc"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Bpmf-i2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Bpmf-i2.svg/20px-Bpmf-i2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Bpmf-i2.svg/40px-Bpmf-i2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="16" width="16" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBOg"/></a></span>) or a horizontal line (<span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File" id="mwBOk"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Bpmf-i.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwBOo"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Bpmf-i.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Bpmf-i.svg/20px-Bpmf-i.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Bpmf-i.svg/40px-Bpmf-i.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="16" width="16" class="mw-file-element" id="mwBOs"/></a></span>); both are accepted forms. Traditionally, it should be written as a horizontal line in vertical writing, and a vertical line in horizontal writing. The People's Republic of China almost exclusively uses horizontal writing, so the vertical form (in the rare occasion that Bopomofo is used) has become the standard form there. Language education in Taiwan generally uses vertical writing, so most people learn it as a horizontal line, and use a horizontal form even in horizontal writing. In 2008, the Taiwanese Ministry of Education decided that the primary form should always be the horizontal form, but that the vertical form is an accepted alternative.<sup about="#mwt494" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-18" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-18"}}'><a href="#cite_note-18" id="mwBOw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBO0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBO4">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBO8">]</span></span></a></sup> Unicode 8.0.0 published an errata in 2014 that updates the representative glyph to be the horizontal form.<sup about="#mwt496" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-19"}}'><a href="#cite_note-19" id="mwBPA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBPE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBPI">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBPM">]</span></span></a></sup> Computer fonts may only display one form or the other, or may be able to display both if the font is aware of changes needed for vertical writing.</p>
<ul class="gallery mw-gallery-traditional skin-invert" typeof="mw:Extension/gallery" about="#mwt497" id="mwBPQ" data-mw='{"name":"gallery","attrs":{"widths":"80","heights":"40","class":"skin-invert"},"body":{}}'>
