</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="14" id="mwCD4" aria-labelledby="Use_outside_Standard_Mandarin"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Use_outside_Standard_Mandarin">Use outside Standard Mandarin</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Bopomofo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section: Use outside Standard Mandarin"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwCD8">Bopomofo symbols for non-Mandarin <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Varieties_of_Chinese" title="Varieties of Chinese" id="mwCEA">Chinese varieties</a> are added to Unicode in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bopomofo_Extended" title="Bopomofo Extended" id="mwCEE">Bopomofo Extended</a> block.</p>

<p id="mwCEI">Three letters no longer used for Mandarin are carried over from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_National_Pronunciation" title="Old National Pronunciation" id="mwCEM">Old National Pronunciation</a>:</p>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwCEQ">
<tbody id="mwCEU"><tr id="mwCEY">
<th id="mwCEc">Bopomofo</th><th id="mwCEg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Phonetic_Alphabet" title="International Phonetic Alphabet" id="mwCEk">IPA</a></th><th id="mwCEo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gwoyeu_Romatzyh" title="Gwoyeu Romatzyh" id="mwCEs">GR</a></th><th id="mwCEw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" id="mwCE0">Pinyin</a></th></tr>
<tr align="center" id="mwCE4">
<td id="mwCE8"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt663" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄪ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄪ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt663" id="mwCFE"/></td><td id="mwCFI"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt664" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"v"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_labiodental_fricative" title="Voiced labiodental fricative">v</a></span></td><td id="mwCFQ">v</td><td id="mwCFU">v</td></tr>
<tr align="center" id="mwCFY">
<td id="mwCFc"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt665" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄫ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄫ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt665" id="mwCFk"/></td><td id="mwCFo"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt666" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCFs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ŋ"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_velar_nasal" title="Voiced velar nasal">ŋ</a></span></td><td id="mwCFw">ng</td><td id="mwCF0">ng</td></tr>
<tr align="center" id="mwCF4">
<td id="mwCF8"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt667" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCGA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄬ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄬ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt667" id="mwCGE"/></td><td id="mwCGI"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt668" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCGM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ɲ"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_palatal_nasal" title="Voiced palatal nasal">ɲ</a></span></td><td id="mwCGQ">gn</td><td id="mwCGU">gn</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<section data-mw-section-id="15" id="mwCGY" aria-labelledby="Taiwanese_Hokkien"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Taiwanese_Hokkien">Taiwanese Hokkien</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Bopomofo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section: Taiwanese Hokkien"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt669" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCGc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Taiwanese Phonetic Symbols"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt670" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt669" id="mwCGg">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwanese_Phonetic_Symbols" title="Taiwanese Phonetic Symbols">Taiwanese Phonetic Symbols</a></div>
<p id="mwCGk">In Taiwan, Bopomofo is used to teach <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwanese_Hokkien" title="Taiwanese Hokkien" id="mwCGo">Taiwanese Hokkien</a>, and it is also used to transcribe it phonetically in contexts such as on storefront signs, karaoke lyrics, and film subtitles.</p>

<p id="mwCGs">23 more letters were added specifically for Taiwanese Hokkien:</p>
<table class="wikitable" id="mwCGw">
<tbody id="mwCG0"><tr id="mwCG4">
<th id="mwCG8">Bopomofo</th>
<th id="mwCHA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Phonetic_Alphabet" title="International Phonetic Alphabet" id="mwCHE">IPA</a></th>
<th id="mwCHI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tâi-uân_Lô-má-jī_Phing-im_Hong-àn" title="Tâi-uân Lô-má-jī Phing-im Hong-àn" id="mwCHM">TL</a></th>
<th id="mwCHQ">Derivation</th></tr>
<tr id="mwCHU">
<td id="mwCHY"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt671" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCHc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㆠ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㆠ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt671" id="mwCHg"/></td>
<td id="mwCHk"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt672" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCHo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"b"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_bilabial_plosive" title="Voiced bilabial plosive">b</a></span></td>
<td id="mwCHs">b</td>
<td id="mwCHw"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt673" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCH0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄅ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄅ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt673" id="mwCH4"/> with voicing circle</td></tr>
<tr id="mwCH8">
<td id="mwCIA"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt674" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCIE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㆣ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㆣ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt674" id="mwCII"/></td>
<td id="mwCIM"><span class="IPA" lang="und-Latn-fonipa" about="#mwt675" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCIQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"IPA link","href":"./Template:IPA_link"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"g"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_velar_plosive" title="Voiced velar plosive">g</a></span></td>
<td id="mwCIU">g</td>
<td id="mwCIY"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt676" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCIc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㄍ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㄍ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt676" id="mwCIg"/> with voicing circle</td></tr>
<tr id="mwCIk">
<td id="mwCIo"><span title="Chinese-language text" about="#mwt677" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCIs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"lang","href":"./Template:Lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"zh-Bopo"},"2":{"wt":"ㆢ"}},"i":0}}]}'><span lang="zh-Bopo">ㆢ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" about="#mwt677" id="mwCIw"/></td>
