<td style="font-family:'Noto Sans CJK JP','BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31B8: BOPOMOFO LETTER GH">ㆸ</td>
<td style="font-family:'Noto Sans CJK JP','BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31B9: BOPOMOFO LETTER LH">ㆹ</td>
<td style="font-family:'Noto Sans CJK JP','BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31BA: BOPOMOFO LETTER ZY">ㆺ</td>
<td style="font-family:'Noto Sans CJK JP','BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31BB: BOPOMOFO FINAL LETTER G">ㆻ</td>
<td style="font-family:'BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31BC: BOPOMOFO LETTER GW">ㆼ</td>
<td style="font-family:'BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31BD: BOPOMOFO LETTER KW">ㆽ</td>
<td style="font-family:'BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31BE: BOPOMOFO LETTER OE">ㆾ</td>
<td style="font-family:'BabelStone Han',Nishiki-teki,sans-serif" title="U+31BF: BOPOMOFO LETTER AH">ㆿ</td></tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="17" style="background:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f8f9fa);color:inherit;font-size:small;text-align:left"><b>Notes</b>
<dl><dd>1.<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1041539562" about="#mwt830" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Citation/styles.css"}}'/><span class="citation wikicite" id="endnote_U31A0_as_of_Unicode_version"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#ref_U31A0_as_of_Unicode_version" class="mw-selflink-fragment">^</a></b></span>As of Unicode version 18.0</dd></dl></td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<p id="mwCic">Unicode 3.0 also added the characters <span class="nowrap" about="#mwt831" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCig" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"02EA"},"2":{"wt":"MODIFIER LETTER YIN DEPARTING TONE MARK"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt832" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+02EA</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt831"><span typeof="mw:Entity">˪</span></span><span about="#mwt831"> </span><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1373397503" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt831" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .unichar-name{font-variant:small-caps;text-transform:lowercase;font-feature-settings:"onum"}</style><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt831" id="mwCik">MODIFIER LETTER YIN DEPARTING TONE MARK</span> and <span class="nowrap" about="#mwt834" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCio" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"unichar","href":"./Template:Unichar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"02EB"},"2":{"wt":"MODIFIER LETTER YANG DEPARTING TONE MARK"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r886049734" about="#mwt835" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Mono/styles.css"}}'/><span class="monospaced">U+02EB</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span style="font-size:125%;line-height:1em" about="#mwt834"><span typeof="mw:Entity">˫</span></span><span about="#mwt834"> </span><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1373397503" about="#mwt834" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Unichar/name/styles.css"}}'/><span class="unichar-name" about="#mwt834" id="mwCis">MODIFIER LETTER YANG DEPARTING TONE MARK</span>, in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spacing_Modifier_Letters" title="Spacing Modifier Letters" id="mwCiw">Spacing Modifier Letters</a> block. These two characters are now (since Unicode 6.0) classified as Bopomofo characters.<sup about="#mwt839" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-29" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-29"}}'><a href="#cite_note-29" id="mwCi0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCi4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCi8">[</span>29<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCjA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<table class="wikitable nounderlines" style="background:#fff; text-align:center;" id="mwCjE">
<tbody id="mwCjI"><tr id="mwCjM"><td colspan="4" style="background:#F8F8F8;font-size:small" id="mwCjQ"><b id="mwCjU">Tonal marks for bopomofo</b><br id="mwCjY"/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spacing_Modifier_Letters" title="Spacing Modifier Letters" id="mwCjc">Spacing Modifier Letters</a></td></tr>
<tr style="background:#F8F8F8" id="mwCjg">
