ass="Z3988" about="#mwt492" id="mwCzU"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-19" id="cite_note-19" data-mw-footnote-number="19"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCzY"><a href="#cite_ref-19" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwCzc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwCzg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-19" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">Unicode Consortium, "<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode8.0.0/erratafixed.html" class="external text" id="mwCzk">Errata Fixed in Unicode 8.0.0</a> <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20201101054445/http://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode8.0.0/erratafixed.html" about="#mwt495" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="external text" id="mwCzo" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Webarchive","href":"./Template:Webarchive"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20201101054445/http://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode8.0.0/erratafixed.html"},"date":{"wt":"2020-11-01"}},"i":0}}]}'>Archived</a><span about="#mwt495" id="mwCzs"> 2020-11-01 at the </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wayback_Machine" title="Wayback Machine" about="#mwt495" id="mwCzw">Wayback Machine</a><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Webarchive_template_wayback_links" about="#mwt495" id="mwCz0"/>"</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-bopomofo2017-20" id="cite_note-bopomofo2017-20" data-mw-footnote-number="20"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwCz4"><a href="#cite_ref-bopomofo2017_20-0" id="mwCz8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwC0A">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-bopomofo2017_20-1" id="mwC0E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwC0I">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-bopomofo2017-20" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt498" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwC0M" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite book","href":"./Template:Cite_book"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://language.moe.gov.tw/001/Upload/files/site_content/M0001/juyin/html_ch/index.html#page02"},"script-title":{"wt":"zh:國語注音手冊"},"language":{"wt":"zh-tw"},"pages":{"wt":"2, 7"},"quote":{"wt":"{{lang|zh-tw|韻符「ㄭ」，陰平調號「¯」，注音時省略不標{...}陰平 以一短橫代表高平之聲調，注音時可省略不標。標注在字音最後一個符號右上角。}}"},"editor":{"wt":"Department of Lifelong Education, Ministry of Education {{lang|zh-tw|教育部終身教育司}}"},"publisher":{"wt":"[[Ministry of Education (Taiwan)|Ministry of Education]]; Digital version: Wanderer Digital Publishing Inc. {{lang|zh-tw|汪達數位出版股份有限公司}}"},"date":{"wt":"January 2017"},"isbn":{"wt":"978-986-051-481-0"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFDepartment_of_Lifelong_Education,_Ministry_of_Education_教育部終身教育司Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text2017" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt498">Department of Lifelong Education, Ministry of Education <span title="Chinese-language text" id="mwC0Q"><span lang="zh-TW" id="mwC0U">教育部終身教育司</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" id="mwC0Y"/>, ed. (January 2017). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://language.moe.gov.tw/001/Upload/files/site_content/M0001/juyin/html_ch/index.html#page02" class="external text" id="mwC0c"><bdi lang="zh" id="mwC0g">國語注音手冊</bdi></a> (in Chinese (Taiwan)). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministry_of_Education_(Taiwan)" title="Ministry of Education (Taiwan)" id="mwC0k">Ministry of Education</a>; Digital version: Wanderer Digital Publishing Inc. <span title="Chinese-language text" id="mwC0o"><span lang="zh-TW" id="mwC0s">汪達數位出版股份有限公司</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" id="mwC0w"/>. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwC00"> </span>2, 7. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwC04">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwC08"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-986-051-481-0" title="Special:BookSources/978-986-051-481-0" id="mwC1A"><bdi id="mwC1E">978-986-051-481-0</bdi></a>. <q id="mwC1I"><span title="Chinese-language text" id="mwC1M"><span lang="zh-TW" id="mwC1Q">韻符「ㄭ」，陰平調號「¯」，注音時省略不標{...}陰平 以一短橫代表高平之聲調，注音時可省略不標。標注在字音最後一個符號右上角。</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" id="mwC1U"/></q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%9C%8B%E8%AA%9E%E6%B3%A8%E9%9F%B3%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8A&amp;rft.pages=2%2C+7&amp;rft.pub=Ministry+of+Education%3B+Digital+version%3A+Wanderer+Digital+Publishing+Inc.+%3Cspan+title%3D%22Chinese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22zh-TW%22%3E%E6%B1%AA%E9%81%94%E6%95%B8%E4%BD%8D%E5%87%BA%E7%89%88%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Chinese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2017-01&amp;rft.isbn=978-986-051-481-0&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Flanguage.moe.gov.tw%2F001%2FUpload%2Ffiles%2Fsite_content%2FM0001%2Fjuyin%2Fhtml_ch%2Findex.html%23page02&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ABopomofo" class="Z3988" about="#mwt498" id="mwC1Y"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Chinese-language_script_(zh)" about="#mwt498" id="mwC1c"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Chinese_(Taiwan)-language_sources_(zh-tw)" about="#mwt498" id="mwC1g"/></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-bopomofo2017en-21" id="cite_note-bopomofo2017en-21" data-mw-footnote-number="21"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwC1k"><a href="#cite_ref-bopomofo2017en_21-0" id="mwC1o"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwC1s">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-bopomofo2017en_21-1" id="mwC1w"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwC10">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-bopomofo2017en-21" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt501" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwC14" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite book","href":"./Template:Cite_book"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://language.moe.gov.tw/001/Upload/files/SITE_CONTENT/M0001/deploy/html_en/index.html"},"title":{"wt":"The Manual of the Phonetic Symbols of Mandarin Chinese"},"editor":{"wt":"Department of Lifelong Education, Ministry of Education {{lang|zh-tw|教育部終身教育司}}"},"language":{"wt":"en,zh-tw"},"publisher":{"wt":"[[Ministry of Education (Taiwan)|Ministry of Education]]; Digital version: Wanderer Digital Publishing Inc. {{lang|zh-tw|汪達數位出版股份有限公司}}"},"pages":{"wt":"2, 7"},"date":{"wt":"January 2017"},"isbn":{"wt":"978-986-051-869-6"},"quote":{"wt":"the rhyme symbol, \"ㄭ\", and the mark of Yin-ping tone, \"¯\", could be left out on Bopomofo notes.{...}This high and level tone is noted as a short dash mark and could be left out in Bopomofo note. If it is noted, it should be put on the upper right corner of the last Bopomofo note."}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="mwC18" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt501" data-x-id="CITEREFDepartment_of_Lifelong_Education,_Ministry_of_Education_教育部終身教育司Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text2017">Department of Lifelong Education, Ministry of Education <span title="Chinese-language text" id="mwC2A"><span lang="zh-TW" id="mwC2E">教育部終身教育司</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" id="mwC2I"/>, ed. (January 2017). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://language.moe.gov.tw/001/Upload/files/SITE_CONTENT/M0001/deploy/html_en/index.html" class="external text" id="mwC2M"><i id="mwC2Q">The Manual of the Phonetic Symbols of Mandarin Chinese</i></a> (in English and Chinese (Taiwan)). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministry_of_Education_(Taiwan)" title="Ministry of Education (Taiwan)" id="mwC2U">Ministry of Education</a>; Digital version: Wanderer Digital Publishing Inc. <span title="Chinese-language text" id="mwC2Y"><span lang="zh-TW" id="mwC2c">汪達數位出版股份有限公司</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text" id="mwC2g"/>. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwC2k"> </span>2, 7. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwC2o">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwC2s"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-986-051-869-6" title="Special:BookSources/978-986-051-869-6" id="mwC2w"><bdi id="mwC20">978-986-051-869-6</bdi></a>. <q id="mwC24">the rhyme symbol, "ㄭ", and the mark of Yin-ping tone, "¯", could be left out on Bopomofo notes.{...}This high and level tone is noted as a short dash mark and could be left out in Bopomofo note. If it is noted, it should be put on the upper right corner of the last Bopomofo note.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=The+Manual+of+the+Phonetic+Symbols+of+Mandarin+Chinese&amp;rft.pages=2%2C+7&amp;rft.pub=Ministry+of+Education%3B+Digital+version%3A+Wanderer+Digital+Publishing+Inc.+%3Cspan+title%3D%22Chinese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22zh-TW%22%3E%E6%B1%AA%E9%81%94%E6%95%B8%E4%BD%8D%E5%87%BA%E7%89%88%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%BD%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Chinese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2017-01&amp;rft.isbn=978-986-051-869-6&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Flanguage.moe.gov.tw%2F001%2FUpload%2Ffiles%2FSITE_CONTENT%2FM0001%2Fdeploy%2Fhtml_en%2Findex.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ABopomofo" class="Z3988" about="#mwt501" id="mwC28"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Chinese_(Taiwan)-language_sources_(zh-tw)" about="#mwt501" id="mwC3A"/></span></li>
